<view class="page"><view class="nav-title">搜索</view><view class="search-row"><image src="/assets/lucide/search.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><input placeholder="搜索公开故事、公共地标" value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="change"/><text wx:if="{{keyword}}" bindtap="reset">×</text></view><scroll-view class="filters" scroll-x="true"><view class="filter {{city !== '城市' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-key="city" data-value="上海" bindtap="choose">{{city}}</view><view class="filter {{scene !== '主题' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-key="scene" data-value="生日祝福" bindtap="choose">{{scene}}</view><view class="filter {{delivery !== '形式' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-key="delivery" data-value="口播视频" bindtap="choose">{{delivery}}</view><view wx:if="{{keyword || city !== '城市' || scene !== '主题' || delivery !== '形式'}}" class="clear" bindtap="reset">全部清除</view></scroll-view><view class="search-empty"><image src="/assets/lucide/search.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text class="empty-title">暂时没有可搜索的公开内容</text><text class="empty-copy">公开故事上线后，可以按城市、公共地标、主题和交付形式在这里找到它们。</text></view></view><bottom-nav active="search" />
